   <p>To his Exl. <persName ref="cwgk:N00000258">B, Magoffin</persName> Governor of the <orgName ref="cwgk:O001025">Commonwealth of Kentucky</orgName></p>
<p>Your petitioners the undersigned would most respectfully state that ^at^ the term of the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00000572">Rockcastle Circuit Court</orgName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00020753">Ben, R, P, Langford</persName> was indicted for an alledged offense of shooting at one <persName ref="cwgk:N00020754">A. J. Mershon</persName> maliciously with intent to Kill. without hiting or wounding him, and the case has been pending in said court ever since and one trial had which resulted in a hung Jury, and not desiring to see said Langford further harrassed and annoyed by said indictment, said Mershon being a notorious bad character now in view of all circumstances We humbly ask your Excellency to pardon the offense</p>
